
<!-- Banner Section -->
<div class="hero-banner text-center text-white">
    <img src="~/img/bernd-dittrich-PSB6bGW-r7k-unsplash.jpg"
         alt="Monitor setup"
         class="hero-image" asp-append-version="true" />

    <!-- Text Overlay -->
    <div class="hero-text">
        <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold">About Me</h1>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Photographer Credit -->
<div class="text-end small mt-2 me-3">
    Photo by <a href="https://unsplash.com/@@radowanrehan" target="_blank">Radowan Nakif Rehan</a> on
    <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/black-flat-screen-computer-monitor-cYyqhdbJ9TI" target="_blank">Unsplash</a>
</div>

<div class="container mt-4 pt-4">
    <hr style="border-top: 4px solid #708090;" />
    @{
        ViewData["Title"] = "About Me";
    }
    <h1 class="text-center">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <hr style="border-top: 4px solid #708090;" />

    <div class="row align-items-center mt-4">
        <!-- Left Column: Image -->
        <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
            <img src="~/img/James Headshot.jpg"
                 alt="James Headshot"
                 class="img-fluid rounded shadow-sm"
                 style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;" asp-append-version="true" />
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: About Text -->
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <p class="mt-4">
                I have a <strong>strong foundation in object-oriented programming</strong> using <strong>Java, C#, and Python</strong>, combined with
                <strong>full-stack development experience in ASP.NET, Spring Boot, React, JavaScript, TypeScript, HTML, and CSS,
                    with exposure to MERN and MEAN stack architectures</strong>,
                enabling me to build <strong>scalable and maintainable applications.</strong> I have also developed
                <strong>mobile applications across iOS (Swift) and Android (Java, Kotlin)</strong>, further expanding my versatility across platforms.
                Through applying <strong>Agile methodologies such as Scrum</strong> and following <strong>software development life cycle
                    (SDLC) best practices</strong>, I contributed to the development of a <strong>Project Management Tool</strong>, where I
                <strong>strengthened my backend development and database integration skills using PostgreSQL and MongoDB.</strong>
                I also leverage <strong>AI-assisted development tools such as GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and ChatGPT</strong>, using
                <strong>effective prompt engineering techniques</strong> to accelerate development, improve code quality, and solve complex problems efficiently.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>